Handoff snapshot of an implementation that was stopped mid-way for the
remote handoff (docs/handoff/audit-resume.md). Do not merge as is.

Intended scope (from the stopped task):
- 0094_collab_stand_in_editors.sql: document_revisions.edited_by uuid[]
  (actual editors when the author only saved for them),
  document_collab_states.editors uuid[], new app_system_collab_store
  signature with editors, app_collab_load returning editors.
- room code records editors since the last revision and fills edited_by
  when the author is not among them (mover, realtime-off admin, other
  connected writer).
- revisions API/web show the actual editors and who saved for them.
- a restore with no open room first saves a live state left pending
  (no stand-in author; 409 if nobody can write it).

State at the snapshot: files were being edited by the task; it was not
built, not tested, not reviewed. Whether it compiles is checked in the
handoff document. Base: 5edd8f4 (PR #64 local head, verified #71 + P-34).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
